VIGOR HELP

Run `vig tutor` for an exercise-driven introduction.

KEY / COMMAND       ACTION

h j k l             move left/down/up/right
w b e / W B E       word / WORD motions
0 ^ $               line start, first text, line end
gg / G              first / last line; counts select line
f t F T ; ,         find character; repeat / reverse
%                   match bracket
Ctrl-D / Ctrl-U     half-page down / up
Ctrl-E / Ctrl-Y     scroll viewport down / up

i a I A             insert at cursor/after/start/end
o O                 open line below / above
x X                 delete at cursor / before cursor
d y c + motion      delete, yank, change
D Y C               delete/yank/change to line end
p P                 paste after / before
u / Ctrl-R          undo / redo
v V                 visual character / line selection

/pattern ?pattern   search forward / backward; literal lowercase ignores case
* # / g* g#         word search; whole / partial
n N                 repeat search / reverse
:command            enter command prompt
:w :q :wq           write, quit, write and quit
:e path             open file in a new buffer
:help               open this help buffer
:md / :markdown     toggle Markdown presentation
:nomd               show literal Markdown source
:cd path / :cdb     change cwd / cd to buffer dir
:pwd                show working directory
:make [args]        run makeprg into quickfix
:qf !command        diagnostic command into quickfix
:rg pattern [path]  ripgrep results in quickfix
:rgf [path]         fzf live ripgrep; Enter adds filtered rows

OPTIONS

:set wrap            wrap long lines           :set nowrap          truncate long lines
:set wrapcol=N       wrap width; 0 uses terminal
:set wrapmove        j/k move display rows     :set nowrapmove      j/k move text lines
:set number          show line numbers         :set nonumber        hide line numbers
:set relativenumber  show relative numbers     :set norelativenumber hide relative numbers
:set autoindent      copy indent on new lines  :set noautoindent    disable autoindent
:set comment=X       comment prefix             :set scrolloff=N     cursor screen margin
:set clipboard=MODE  osc52, auto, or off       :set yankflash=N     yank highlight ms
:set mouse=MODE      off, scroll, cursor, visual; wheel scrolls 3 rows
:set delcopy         deletes update register   :set nodelcopy       preserve register
:set rghidden        rg includes filenames     :set norghidden      default rg filenames
:set hlsearch        highlight search matches  :set nohlsearch      hide search matches
:set markdownfences  hide :md fence lines      :set nomarkdownfences show fence lines
:set makeprg=CMD     build command for :make
scripts/vig-diagnostics [--cwd DIR] CMD... normalizes diagnostics

.py .c .h .sh .bash  automatic string/comment highlighting
:md aligns Markdown tables virtually; editing restores literal source
markdownfences hides ``` and ~~~ marker lines in :md Markdown view

<space>d            delete current buffer
<space>w            toggle line wrapping
<space>j / k        next / previous quickfix item
<space>c            switch to quickfix
<space>o            open quickfix location
<space>n / N        next / previous buffer

Esc                 return to Normal / cancel prompt
Ctrl-C Ctrl-C       quit all buffers
Ctrl-C q            force quit all buffers

See reference.md for the complete command reference.
